  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 806.01 Insufficient Remittance. If the register of deeds is presented an instrument to record and the accompanying remittance is insufficient to pay for the tax and the recording fee, the remittance shall be first applied to the tax.\n\nSource. INTERIM #4705, eff 11-21-89; ss by #5300, eff 12-26-91; ss by #6691, eff 2-21-98, EXPIRED: 2-21-06\n\nNew. #8579, eff 3-8-06; ss by #10665, eff 9-9-14; ss by 14071, eff 9-10-24",
